//RS ///   - **static methods** — no `self` parameter; an associated function on the
//RS ///     type (`Type.make(x) -> Type`). The body + every static call site
//RS ///     (`Type.make(x)` → `__jet_Type::__jet_make(x)`) are covered.
//RS ///
//RS /// The owning `type_name` must itself be a covered struct or enum (so the receiver
//RS /// place + field reads emit exactly as `emit_method` does). This is a coverage
//RS /// report (`validate_tir_support`), not a lowering filter: program lowering
//RS /// lowers every inherent method, as it lowers every free function, so a refusal
//RS /// here can never drop a method its callers still name (I2).
